      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "4. In view of this Court, since the Applicants are five in numbers and it is a matrimonial discord and the matter dates back to 2023, it would be better and in the interest of justice that the parties to appear in person before this Court on the next date so that the present Misc. application may be disposed of.",
